
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Meu Corre</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #101827;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #22c55e;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .card {
            background: #1e293b;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        .valor {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #22c55e;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>🚴 MEU CORRE</h1>
    <p style="text-align:center;">Seu painel de entregas</p>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>💰 Ganhos do dia</h2>
        <p class="valor">R$ 0,00</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>📦 Entregas realizadas</h2>
        <p class="valor">0</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>⏱️ Horas trabalhadas</h2>
        <p class="valor">0h</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>🎯 Meta diária</h2>
        <p class="valor">R$ 150,00</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>